   445	$-(\pi - 2\arctan(2/\sqrt{63}))$ radians, whose degree reading rounds to
   446	the official $-16.60$ degrees -- the negative sign being the official
   447	``$16.60$ degrees below the initial line of motion''.  The recorded
   448	official value first appears here, conclusion-side.
   449	\end{theorem}
